{%- comment -%}
  URL of the Sale (Black Friday) collection, for the red "Sale" / "Saldi"
  links (desktop nav, mobile drawer, Shop page sidebar, collection
  filter bar). The collection is picked in Theme settings > Sale; if
  nothing is picked it falls back to the "black-friday" collection.
  collection.url is resolved per request, so it follows the visitor's
  language (/it/collections/...).
  Usage: <a href="{% render 'pm-sale-url' %}">
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign pm_sale_collection = settings.pm_sale_collection
  if pm_sale_collection == blank
    assign pm_sale_collection = collections['black-friday']
  endif
-%}{{- pm_sale_collection.url | default: '/collections/black-friday' -}}
